<WizardContent @headerText="Initialization" @glyph="tour">
  <WizardSection
    @headerText="Setting up your root keys"
    @docText="Learn: Initialization"
    @docPath="/intro/getting-started/deploy.html#initializing-the-vault"
  >
    <p>
      This is the very first step of setting up a Himitsu Vault server. Himitsu Vault comes with an important security
      feature called a "seal", which lets you shut down and secure your Himitsu Vault installation if there is a security
      breach. This is the default state of Himitsu Vault, so it is currently sealed since it was just installed. To unseal
      Himitsu Vault, you will need to provide the key(s) that you generate here.
    </p>
  </WizardSection>
</WizardContent>